      "bookTitle": "Man and His Symbols",
      "author": "Carl G. Jung",
      "category": "Philosophy",
      "type": "concept",
      "headline": "Synchronicity: Meaningful Flukes",
      "body": "Ever think of an old friend out of nowhere, and thirty seconds later they text you? Synchronicity is when an inner psychological state connects meaningfully with an outside physical event.",
